{'symbol': 'AWK', 'date': '2022-12-14 11:00:00', 'title': "AMERICAN WATER RECOGNIZED ON NEWSWEEK'S AMERICA'S MOST RESPONSIBLE COMPANIES 2023 LIST", 'text': "CAMDEN, N.J.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--AMERICAN WATER (NYSE: AWK), THE LARGEST PUBLICLY TRADED U.S. WATER AND WASTEWATER UTILITY COMPANY, ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED ON NEWSWEEK'S LIST OF AMERICA'S MOST RESPONSIBLE COMPANIES 2023. RANKED NO. 5 IN THE ENERGY AND UTILITIES INDUSTRY CATEGORY, THIS RECOGNITION ILLUSTRATES AMERICAN WATER'S CONTINUED COMMITMENT TO ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE (“ESG”) LEADERSHIP."}